{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばちは\n早く寝る準備ができても早くベットに入ってもなんだか勿体ない気がして夜更かしして後悔します。\n早寝できる人って私の中で大人です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐々木久美です🦒くみてんです🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ！明日は、読売テレビ「ベストヒット歌謡祭」に出演させていただきます！個人的にとても思い入れのある番組なのでとっても嬉しいです💛気合入れて「ってか」披露させていただきます🕺❤️‍🔥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"載せられていなかった写真たちを〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VEW2RP6P351VX061BRXKT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VEX5AYY6SB7AFV63HQAA1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VEY6ST6G800D090MRWB1B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VEZ9WKTEP0AW0KZHTBDY8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nヒット祈願の時の写真です🎨つなぎで絵を描くなんてなんだか美大生になれたみたいで嬉しかったです🦋🖤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VF0BJQXRJKG8SKT151H3C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">これはなんかのモノマネしてチームのみんなで撮ったけどなんの真似したかすっかり忘れました。楽しすぎるチームでしたな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VF1J6JTAH28RMW0KNHWVK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VF2KJJ0WG827PVVP8QYDS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VF3NM1KMM1HYZE4C8A1DY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VF4QMADTRZW29CTNQ0XJW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n思い出いっぱい🌻ここからはMVのオフショットです〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VF5RQ6SARXA187ADS42FR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VF6SB5RVN23SP9V4550AZ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VF7SH44NMGB03FQF0YG8D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VF8YQ5P4YEYJST33K93Q2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VFA0HPC4AF10WVTSRB1QR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VFB2S7H9Q2CTWR1H4HY9V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VFC2FGAV76AQ3G0X37G5H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">セットも可愛くて休憩時間も美穂ちゃんと写真を撮る旅に出てました☂️現像するまで出来がわからないのがたまらない楽しさなんです〜#KUMIFILM"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VFD5601V6QW3FH5J539NJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3VFE68QX56MGNC1M73WQ1D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nこれはエセフィルム写真🌝またツアーやひなたの夏休みのオフショット載せます〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}